    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17783" root="زعق" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعَّاقٌ</span></b>  <i>One who drives away the beasts, and
cries out after them.</i> (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَاعِقٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Applied to a horse, <i>A good goer;</i> or <i>strong to
walk,</i> or <i>go:</i> (Ibn-' Abbád, K:) and also (Ibn-
' Abbád) <i>very quick.</i> (Ibn-' Abbád, K.)

